  if (warnings.length > 0) {
    console.error('\n⚠️  SECURITY WARNING: Supply chain compromise indicators detected');
    console.error('   Reference: Huntress axios@1.14.1 advisory (March 2026)\n');
    warnings.forEach(w => console.error(`   ${w}`));
    console.error('\n   Action: Run "npm cache clean --force" and rotate any credentials on this machine.\n');
  }
}
```

This check is non-blocking, adds no dependencies, and could save affected users significant incident response time.

