- gitnexus: 1.6.5 (installed via `volta install gitnexus@1.6.5`)
- Hook file inspected: `<volta>/tools/image/packages/gitnexus/node_modules/gitnexus/hooks/claude/gitnexus-hook.cjs`
- Node: 24.13.0
- npm: 11.x
- OS: Windows 11
- Shell context: Claude Code

